SUMMARY:EastVille Comedy Club LIVE at Eastville Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nGet ready for the time of your life at EastVille\, Brooklyn’s legendary comedy club! This historic venue has hosted world-renowned comedians like Chris Rock\, Mel Brooks\, and Joan Rivers for ages. \nThe best part? No minimum drink order is required — just your ticket on your smartphone! Enjoy stress-free seating with plenty of options\, and treat yourself to specially-crafted cocktails and delicious homemade popcorn. You’re guaranteed to be in stitches for a full hour and 30 minutes! \nEvent Details\nDate: Various dates available (select during purchase)\nTime: 8:00 PM and 9:45 PM shows\nDuration: 90 minutes\nLocation: Eastville Comedy Club\, 487 Atlantic Avenue\, Brooklyn\, NY 11217\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome; children under 16 must be accompanied by an adult\nAccessibility: Wheelchair accessible\nNote: All sales are final. \nAbout the Venue\nEastville Comedy Club is located at 487 Atlantic Avenue in Brooklyn\, NY. This historic venue is easily accessible via the Atlantic Ave B/Q subway stop\, Nevins St 2/3/4/5\, and Hoyt-Schermerhorn A/C/G stations. \nWhat to Expect\nLaugh along with world-renowned comedians in a stress-free\, welcoming environment. Enjoy specially-crafted cocktails and delicious homemade popcorn with no drink minimum required. Every night features a unique rotating lineup guaranteed to deliver belly laughs. \nTicket Information\nGeneral Admission tickets are $30.00. No booking fees. All ages welcome. All sales are final. \nGet Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/eastville-comedy-club-live-at-eastville-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Eastville Comedy Club\, 487 Atlantic Avenue\, Brooklyn\, NY\, 11217\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/191a694a-140b-11ee-91c1-8a9086f1d54d
GEO:40.6859198;-73.9816191
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Eastville Comedy Club 487 Atlantic Avenue Brooklyn NY 11217 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=487 Atlantic Avenue:geo:-73.9816191,40.6859198
END:VEVENT
