SUMMARY:Thank Comedy It's Friday Late Night Stand Up Show LIVE at The Comic Strip
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nKick off the weekend with the funniest stand-up comedy show around at the iconic Comic Strip Live. “Thank Comedy It’s Friday” is the perfect way to shake off the week and dive into the weekend with a smile. \nCatch hilarious sets from top comedians seen on Netflix\, HBO\, Comedy Central\, BET\, and viral social media platforms. Enjoy a live show soundtrack provided by DJ E.M. to keep the energy high all night long. \nEvent Details\nDate: Every Friday Night\nTime: Doors at 10:00 PM\, Showtime at 10:30 PM\nLocation: Comic Strip Live\, 1568 2nd Avenue\, New York\, NY 10028\nAge Requirement: 21+ with valid ID\nNote: A two-item minimum purchase per person is required at the event \nAbout the Venue\nThe Comic Strip is one of New York City’s most iconic comedy clubs\, located at 1568 2nd Avenue on the Upper East Side. Accessible via the 77th St (6 train) and 86th St (Q train) subway stations. \nWhat to Expect\nBring your friends\, grab a drink\, and enjoy an evening packed with jokes\, good vibes\, and great company. The show features talent from Netflix and Comedy Central with DJ E.M. keeping the energy high between sets. It’s the ultimate Friday night out in NYC. \nTicket Information\nGeneral Admission tickets are $25.00. No booking fees. Age 21+ with valid ID required. Two-item minimum purchase per person at the event. \nGet Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/thank-comedy-its-friday-late-night-stand-up-show-live-at-the-comic-strip-2/
LOCATION:The Comic Strip\, 1568 2nd Avenue\, New York\, NY 10028\, New York\, NY\, 10028\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/5d2619f6-48b3-11f1-af1d-da134b150e66.jpeg
