SUMMARY:Colin Mochrie & Asad Mecci: HYPROV Improv Under Hypnosis LIVE at OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino (Night 2)
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nColin Mochrie & Asad Mecci: HYPROV Improv Under Hypnosis LIVE at OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino (Night 2)\nDon’t miss the second night of HYPROV: Improv Under Hypnosis as Colin Mochrie and master hypnotist Asad Mecci return to the OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino in Niagara Falls\, Ontario on Sunday\, August 23\, 2026. This groundbreaking show combines the art of hypnosis with live improv comedy for a truly one-of-a-kind experience. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026\nTime: 3:00 PM (Doors open 1 hour prior)\nVenue: OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nAddress: 6366 Stanley Ave\, Niagara Falls\, ON L2G 0Z1\, Canada\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome (children 12 and under must be accompanied by an adult)\nParking: Available across the street at Fallsview Casino Resort \nAbout Colin Mochrie & Asad Mecci\nColin Mochrie is best known as a beloved cast member of the hit improv comedy show Whose Line Is It Anyway?\, where his quick wit and fearless improvisation made him a household name. Asad Mecci is a world-renowned master hypnotist who has performed for audiences across the globe. Together\, they created HYPROV — a revolutionary live show that blends the unpredictability of improv comedy with the astonishing power of hypnosis. \nWhat to Expect\n\nAudience volunteers are hypnotized on stage and become the stars of the show\nColin Mochrie improvises hilarious scenes with the hypnotized participants\nEvery performance is completely unique — no two shows are ever the same\nA perfect blend of comedy\, wonder\, and audience participation\nSuitable for all ages (children 12 and under must be with an adult)\nPhone-free experience — Yondr pouches will be used during the performance\n\nVenue Information\nOLG Stage at Fallsview Casino is one of Niagara Falls’ premier entertainment venues\, located at 6366 Stanley Ave inside the iconic Fallsview Casino Resort. With a capacity of 5\,000\, it offers excellent sightlines and world-class amenities. The venue is accessible via the Galleria walkway in Fallsview Casino Resort or from Murray St./Stanley Ave at street level. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $54 and are available now through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are also available through VividSeats. There is an 8-ticket limit per order. Accessible seating is available — contact the venue for details. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/colin-mochrie-asad-mecci-hyprov-improv-under-hypnosis-live-at-olg-stage-fallsview-casino-night-two/
LOCATION:OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\, 6366 Stanley Ave\, Niagara Falls\, ON\, L2G 3Y5\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/3f7b379b-1e42-41a2-acd7-ddafeccd5b13_1748981_RETINA_PORTRAIT_16_9-VDdF9U.jpg
GEO:43.0829695;-79.0839706
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino 6366 Stanley Ave Niagara Falls ON L2G 3Y5 Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=6366 Stanley Ave:geo:-79.0839706,43.0829695
END:VEVENT
