SUMMARY:Leanne Morgan: THE TIME OF OUR LIVES TOUR LIVE at The Orpheum Theatre Memphis (Sunday Matinee)
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Leanne Morgan\nLeanne Morgan is one of the most beloved stand-up comedians in America today\, known for her warm Southern charm\, razor-sharp wit\, and deeply relatable humor about family life\, marriage\, and the hilarious realities of getting older. \nHailing from Tennessee\, Leanne spent years performing at small clubs before her career exploded thanks to viral social media clips and her Netflix special I’m Every Woman. Her comedy resonates with audiences of all ages — especially women who see their own lives reflected in her stories about husbands\, kids\, and the chaos of everyday Southern living. \nFans can expect a night filled with laugh-out-loud storytelling\, relatable observations\, and the kind of genuine warmth that makes Leanne Morgan one of the most in-demand comedians on the road today. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026\nTime: 4:00 PM (Doors open approximately 1 hour prior)\nVenue: The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\nAddress: 203 S. Main St.\, Memphis\, TN 38103\nTicket Prices: $95 – $816+\nContent Advisory: Adult humor; recommended for ages 18+\n\nAbout The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\nThe Orpheum Theatre Memphis is one of the most iconic and storied entertainment venues in the American South. Originally opened in 1928\, this stunning historic theater seats approximately 2\,400 guests and is renowned for its breathtaking Beaux-Arts architecture\, ornate chandeliers\, and plush seating that transports audiences to a golden era of live entertainment. \nLocated in the heart of downtown Memphis at 203 S. Main St.\, the Orpheum sits just steps from the legendary Beale Street entertainment district. The venue offers excellent sightlines from virtually every seat in the house\, with sections including the Orchestra\, Mezzanine\, Grand Tier\, Balcony\, and Gallery levels. \nAmenities include multiple concession stands\, full bar service\, and accessible seating options throughout the theater. Parking is available in nearby garages and surface lots along Main Street and in the surrounding downtown area. The venue is also accessible via the Main Street Trolley line. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up comedy performance by Leanne Morgan as part of her THE TIME OF OUR LIVES TOUR — a nationwide headline tour celebrating her meteoric rise to comedy stardom. The Sunday matinee show at 4:00 PM is a rare afternoon performance\, making it a perfect option for fans who prefer an earlier show time. \nExpect approximately 90 minutes of non-stop laughter as Leanne takes the stage at the magnificent Orpheum. Her storytelling style is conversational and intimate\, even in a large theater setting — she has a gift for making every audience member feel like she’s talking directly to them. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan or discovering Leanne Morgan for the first time\, this show promises to be an unforgettable evening (or afternoon!) of comedy in one of Memphis’s most beautiful venues. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Leanne Morgan at The Orpheum Theatre Memphis on August 23\, 2026 (4:00 PM) are available now. Prices range from $95 to $816+ depending on seat location and availability. \nPurchase official tickets directly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale tickets through VividSeats for a wide selection of seat options. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/leanne-morgan-the-time-of-our-lives-tour-live-at-the-orpheum-theatre-memphis-sunday-matinee/
LOCATION:The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\, 203 S. Main St.\, Memphis\, TN\, 38103\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/e244b269-a579-4c18-9104-2f8f21c13da9_CUSTOM-urIsGe.jpg
GEO:35.140187;-90.0554831
