SUMMARY:Tony Dabas LIVE at Raleigh Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout Tony Dabas\nTony Dabas is a stand-up comedian with over 13 years of experience performing in clubs across the country. Known for embodying a wide range of characters and voices\, he blends stand-up with sharp character work and accents drawn from his diverse background. His ability to seamlessly shift between personas and dialects has made him one of the most distinctive voices in comedy today. \nDabas started his career opening for comedians nationwide\, working his way through respected venues including Improv rooms and major comedy clubs across the U.S. Over the past year\, he has transitioned into headlining\, touring as a featured act across multiple cities. He has opened for notable comedians including Felipe Esparza and performers from Saturday Night Live. \nIn addition to his live performances\, Tony has built a massive presence on social media\, creating viral sketch content that reaches millions of viewers each month. His unique blend of character comedy\, accents\, and relatable storytelling has earned him a dedicated fanbase that spans across demographics. Catch him live before he becomes a household name. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026 \nShow Time: 6:00 PM EDT (Doors open at 4:30 PM) \nVenue: Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC 27519 \nAge Restriction: 21+ (Valid photo ID required for entry) \nTicket Prices: $26.67 – $101.73 (includes fees and taxes) \nNote: There is a two-item minimum purchase requirement in the showroom for all guests. No cell phone use\, photography\, or video recording is permitted during performances. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Raleigh Improv is the Triangle area’s premier comedy club\, located at 1224 Parkside Main St in Cary\, NC — just minutes from downtown Raleigh. Part of the nationally recognized Improv Comedy Club chain\, the Raleigh Improv has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy and continues to be the go-to destination for world-class comedy in the Research Triangle. \nThe venue features a full-service restaurant and bar\, offering guests a complete dining and entertainment experience. Seating is general admission and first-come\, first-served\, with the exception of reserved groups and premium booths. Premium booth options include a $200 food and beverage credit per booth\, making it a great choice for special occasions or group outings. \nThe intimate showroom setting ensures every seat has a great view of the stage\, creating an up-close and personal comedy experience. The venue is conveniently located in the Parkside Town Commons shopping center\, with ample parking available. The Raleigh Improv is a 21+ venue\, so be sure to bring a valid photo ID. \nWhat to Expect\nTony Dabas delivers a kinetic\, high-energy performance packed with characters\, voices\, and rapid-fire crowd work. His sets feel spontaneous and alive — no two shows are exactly alike because he feeds off the energy of the room and improvises in real time. Expect to see a comedian who can make you laugh with a single look\, a perfectly timed accent\, or a character that feels like someone you actually know. \nThis is a solo headlining show\, giving you a full evening with one of comedy’s most exciting emerging talents. Dabas’s style is accessible and inclusive — his humor draws from universal experiences while showcasing his unique multicultural perspective. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discovering him for the first time\, this show promises to be a memorable night of laughs. \nArrive early to grab a great seat and enjoy dinner and drinks before the show. The two-item minimum ensures you’ll be well-fed and ready to laugh. This is a 21+ event\, so leave the kids at home and enjoy a proper adults-only night out. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $26.67 – $101.73 (includes fees and taxes) \nTicket options include General Admission ($20 + fees)\, GA Booth for 4 ($70 + fees)\, VIP Ticket ($35 + fees)\, and VIP Premium Booth for 4 ($85 + fees). All sales are final. No refunds\, transfers\, or exchanges. \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tony-dabas-live-at-raleigh-improv/
LOCATION:Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC\, 27519\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/73_Edp-FnuoVz.png
