SUMMARY:12th Annual Desi Comedy Fest LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\nAbout the Desi Comedy Fest\nThe Desi Comedy Fest is one of the most celebrated South Asian comedy showcases in the United States\, now in its 12th year. Founded to showcase the best South Asian and South Asian-American comedians\, the festival has grown into a beloved institution that brings together some of the funniest voices from the Desi comedy community. \nThis year’s Sacramento edition features Samson Koletkar\, one of the most acclaimed South Asian comedians working today. Known for his sharp wit\, cultural observations\, and ability to bridge the gap between South Asian and American experiences\, Samson delivers a comedy show that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. \nThe Desi Comedy Fest is a celebration of diversity\, culture\, and the universal power of laughter. Whether you’re South Asian or simply a fan of great comedy\, this show promises to be an unforgettable evening of laughs. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open one hour before the show) \nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825 \nAge Restriction: 18+ event. Two-beverage minimum per person. No re-entry. \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is one of the most celebrated comedy venues on the West Coast\, located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, California. The intimate club seats approximately 300 guests in a tiered layout that ensures excellent sightlines from every seat. \nThe venue features a full bar and dining service\, with a two-beverage minimum per guest. The warm\, welcoming atmosphere and professional sound system make it the ideal setting for an evening of world-class stand-up comedy. Parking is available in the surrounding area. \nPunch Line Sacramento has hosted legends of comedy and continues to be the premier destination for live stand-up in the Sacramento region. \nWhat to Expect\nThe 12th Annual Desi Comedy Fest is a multi-comedian showcase featuring some of the best South Asian stand-up talent in the country. Expect a diverse lineup of comedians bringing their unique perspectives on culture\, identity\, family\, and the immigrant experience — all wrapped in hilarious\, relatable comedy. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum. This is a unique opportunity to experience the vibrant world of Desi comedy in an intimate club setting. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $40 – $70 (includes fees) \nPurchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale options through VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/desi-comedy-fest-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA\, 95825
