DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nRaphael Ghanem LIVE at The Regent Theater\nBrazilian comedian and actor Raphael Ghanem brings his hilarious stand-up show “A Carne Só Cai no Prato do Vegano” to The Regent Theater in Downtown Los Angeles. \nKnown for his sharp observational humor and energetic stage presence\, Raphael Ghanem delivers a one-of-a-kind comedy experience. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM PDT \nVenue: The Regent Theater \nAddress: 448 S. Main St.\, Los Angeles\, CA 90013 \nAge Requirement: Please check venue for age restrictions \nAbout Raphael Ghanem\nRaphael Ghanem is a celebrated Brazilian comedian and actor known for his unique blend of storytelling and observational comedy. \nHe has built a massive following in Brazil and internationally\, bringing his signature humor to audiences across the globe. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy performance\nHilarious observational humor and storytelling\nOne night only at The Regent Theater in Downtown LA\nA unique international comedy experience\nIntimate venue setting for an up-close performance\n\nVenue Information\nThe Regent Theater is located at 448 S. Main St. in the heart of Downtown Los Angeles\, CA. \nIt is a historic entertainment venue known for hosting world-class comedy shows\, concerts\, and live events. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $78. Grab yours before they sell out! \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
