SUMMARY:Dave Landau LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nDave Landau is one of the most sought-after stand-up comedians working today. Getting his start in Detroit at the Second City’s Conservatory\, Dave developed a fast-paced\, sharp style with a strong improv background that sets him apart from the crowd. \nHis laid-back demeanor and dark style of comedy landed him on Comedy Central’s This is Not Happening (3.1 million views) and as a Season 8 finalist on NBC’s Last Comic Standing. He is the creator of Normal World\, currently on BlazeTV\, and his impressive resume includes The Artie Lange and Anthony Cumia Show\, The Anthony Cumia Show with Dave Landau\, and Louder with Crowder. \nDave has also appeared on the Joe Rogan Experience\, Kill Tony\, Fox Across America\, Gutfeld!\, and Fox Saturday Night. He regularly performs at clubs and theaters across the country and has opened for legends like Dave Chappelle\, Dennis Miller\, and Steven Wright. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, August 26\, 2026\nTime: 6:30 PM HST (Doors open at 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu\, HI 96815\nShow Duration: Approximately 75-90 minutes\nAge Restrictions: 18+ event\nNote: A second show is also available at 9:00 PM the same evening\n\nAbout the Venue\nBlue Note Hawaii is Honolulu’s premier intimate live entertainment venue\, located at 2335 Kalakaua Avenue in the heart of Waikiki. Part of the legendary Blue Note Jazz Club brand\, this venue brings world-class comedy and music to the islands in an intimate\, club-style setting. \nThe venue features communal and premium seating with a first-come\, first-served policy — so arriving early is highly recommended to secure the best seats. A full dinner menu and full bar are available throughout the show\, with a $20 food or beverage minimum per person required. \nBlue Note Hawaii has a capacity of approximately 300 guests\, creating an incredibly intimate atmosphere where you feel close to the performer. The Waikiki location means you’re steps away from the beach\, world-class restaurants\, and the vibrant nightlife of one of the world’s most famous resort destinations. \nWhat to Expect\nDave Landau’s show at Blue Note Hawaii is part of the venue’s acclaimed Blue Note Comedy Series. This is an intimate stand-up performance in a dinner-club setting — a very different experience from a large arena show. \nExpect sharp\, fast-paced comedy with a dark edge\, delivered in an up-close-and-personal environment. Dave’s improv background means no two shows are exactly alike — he feeds off the crowd and the energy of the room. Arrive at 5:00 PM when doors open to enjoy dinner before the show and secure your preferred seating. \nThis is the early show (6:30 PM). A late show is also available at 9:00 PM for those who prefer a later start. Both shows are 18+ only\, so please bring valid photo ID. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $25 – $35 (plus fees; resale prices may vary) \n\nPremium Seating: $35 (+$10.90 fees)\nLoge Seating & Bar Area: $25 (+$9.10 fees)\n$20 food or beverage minimum per person required at the venue\n\nPurchase official tickets through TicketWeb (Ticketmaster partner)\, or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/dave-landau-live-at-blue-note-hawaii-2/
LOCATION:Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu\, HI\, 96815\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/33_Edp-z5t8uc.png
GEO:21.2771844;-157.8275909
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Blue Note Hawaii 2335 Kalakaua Avenue Honolulu HI 96815 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2335 Kalakaua Avenue:geo:-157.8275909,21.2771844
END:VEVENT
