SUMMARY:Vic DiBitetto LIVE at Raleigh Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nVic DiBitetto is an incredibly powerful performer who churns energy\, honesty\, and humanity into nonstop laughter. His pace is frenetic\, he holds no hostages\, and he has been called a cross between Rodney Dangerfield\, Ralph Kramden\, and a hurricane. The bottom line: DiBitetto leaves his audiences breathless with laughter. \nA successful national headliner who regularly sells out theaters across the US\, Vic is an internet sensation with over 500 million views worldwide. He was featured in Kevin James’ film Mall Cop 2\, regularly appears on the nationally syndicated daytime TV show Right This Minute\, and has headlined the Three Tenors (Who Can’t Sing) Tour across the country. \nVic has appeared on America’s Funniest People (ABC) where he was a $10\,000 Grand Prize winner\, as well as Stand-Up Spotlight (VH1). His NY Giants and NY Yankees videos are frequently discussed on ESPN\, YES Network\, and WFAN radio\, making him a beloved figure both in comedy clubs and sports media alike. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM EDT (Doors open at 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Raleigh Improv\nAddress: 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC 27519\nAge Restriction: 21+ (valid ID required)\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required in the showroom for all guests. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Raleigh Improv is the Triangle area’s premier comedy club\, located in the heart of Cary’s Parkside Town Commons. Part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club chain\, the Raleigh Improv offers an intimate\, club-style atmosphere where every seat feels close to the stage. \nThe venue features general admission seating (first-come\, first-served) as well as premium booth options that include a $200 food and beverage credit. The full-service bar and kitchen menu make it easy to enjoy dinner and drinks before and during the show. \nParking is available in the surrounding Parkside Town Commons shopping center lots. The venue is easily accessible from I-40 and US-1\, making it convenient for guests coming from Raleigh\, Durham\, Chapel Hill\, and surrounding areas. \nWhat to Expect\nVic DiBitetto is the kind of comedian who grabs the room from the first second and never lets go. His high-energy\, no-holds-barred style is equal parts hilarious and heartfelt — expect big laughs\, big personality\, and the kind of raw\, relatable humor that has made him one of the most beloved comics working today. \nThis is a 21+ Thursday night show with an intimate club atmosphere. Arrive early to grab your seats\, order from the full menu\, and get ready for a performance that will have you laughing from start to finish. Don’t miss one of stand-up’s most explosive live acts. \nNo cell phone use\, photography\, or video recording is permitted during the performance. All sales are final. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $80 (plus fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/vic-dibitetto-live-at-raleigh-improv/
LOCATION:Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC\, 27519\, United States Of America
